<title>FRANCE: Imetal H1 net attrib marginaly higher.</title>
<headline>Imetal H1 net attrib marginaly higher.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     317  vs	     311</p>
<p>    Operating					543  vs	     542</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   488  vs	     494</p>
<p>    Cashflow					 547  vs	     549</p>
<p>    Turnover				     3,957  vs	   4,065</p>
<p>NOTE - Imetal gave its results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
